OL,3,AWilliam and Kate reflect on 'enduring'
OL,4,AUK-India ties with Modi
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales have
OL,7,Fmet with Prime Minister Narendra Modi
OL,8,Fto reflect on the enduring ties between
OL,9,Fthe UK and India, as they wrapped up
OL,10,Ftheir three-day visit to the country.
OL,12,FWilliam and Catherine arrived in New
OL,13,FDelhi on Wednesday for the final leg of
OL,14,Ftheir first official overseas trip
OL,15,Ftogether in four years.
OL,17,FThe meeting was a late addition to the
OL,18,Fcouple's schedule and came after Modi
OL,19,Fconfirmed he would be back from a
OL,20,Fscheduled trip to the Philippines in
OL,21,Ftime to see the royals.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
